    "title": "13-yr-old electrocuted to death while trying to retrieve kite - Hindustan Times",
    "text": "A 13-year-old boy died due to electrocution while trying to retrieve a kite that got stuck in high-tension electric wires in Yamunanagar police said on Wednesday.The incident took place in Dharamkot village on Tuesday, they said, adding that two other boys had a narrow escape.Police said the victim died due to severe burns caused by an electric shock.He was immediately taken to a hospital where doctors declared him dead.",
